{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11110060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1111006001:0":{"text":"くそっ！サンドクローの奴らめ、いつか必ず報いを受けるぞ！","source_cn":"啐！这群该死的流沙之爪，早晚会遭报应！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6281B82C47D55A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111006002:0":{"text":"ああ必ず、俺たちが奴らに報いを受けさせてやる。","source_cn":"说对了，我们就是流沙之爪的报应。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD7C4C44FE12323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111006003:0":{"text":"お前はなぜ捕まったんだ？","source_cn":"你是怎么被抓的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE32D41000C55209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111006004:0":{"text":"……商隊と一緒に鹹水町（かんすいちょう）を出たあと、突然砂嵐に遭ってな。闇雲に進んでたら、分かれ道に入ったんだ……","source_cn":"……我跟着商队离开咸水镇，结果路上遇到一场大沙暴。向导...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC22F212EE1A8D060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111006005:0":{"text":"商隊の奴らも散り散りになっちまって、俺は砂嵐をやり過ごすためにこのキャンプに避難したんだよ。そしたら――","source_cn":"商队的人走的走、散的散，我发现这处营地，想借个地方避避...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E1875B2C447BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111006006:0":{"text":"サンドクローの懐に飛び込んだってわけか。","source_cn":"正中流沙之爪下怀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x825F489962235643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111006007:0":{"text":"もう行け。","source_cn":"你走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDCD395CC9C254D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111006008:0":{"text":"あ、ありがとう！道中、もし商隊の奴らに出くわしたら、どうか助けてやってくれ……","source_cn":"谢、谢谢！要是你们在路上遇到商队的其他人，也请帮帮他们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA0E90CB5EACD10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旅商乔瓦尼":{"text":"旅商人ジョワンニ","source":"旅商乔瓦尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"ウォルク","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}